  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EMPOWER! programme is providing increased knowledge and skills to education stakeholders to mitigate socio-cultural and systemic barriers to quality education for vulnerable children, particularly girls, in Upper Nile state, South Sudan. The programme is providing training opportunities and awareness raising sessions on gender-sensitive education, inclusion and positive discipline to teachers and education stakeholders at local and district levels.</narrative>
  </description>
